    patient:[['Understand the workspace','认识工作台','The menu focuses on your measurements, medication, records, and tasks.','菜单集中展示你的测量、用药、档案和任务。','Scan the highlighted navigation groups.','浏览高亮的导航分组。','#nav','Look here','看这里','Only your authorized health pages are visible.','只显示你已获授权的健康页面。','A focused menu makes daily self-management easier.','聚焦的菜单让日常自我管理更简单。'],['Start with today’s care','从今日照护开始','Today combines medication, measurements, appointments, and follow-ups.','今日页面整合用药、测量、预约和随访。','Click the highlighted Today entry and check unfinished tasks.','点击高亮的今日任务并检查未完成事项。','Your care plan and pending actions appear.','页面显示照护计划和待办事项。','Completing the daily list improves care continuity.','完成每日清单可以提高照护连续性。','[data-page="today"]','Start here','从这里开始','today']],
